      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785953364859,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirement:\n- Find opponent via skill-based matchmatching\n- Play real-time game with server-validated moves\n- View global leaderboard\n\n\nNon-functional requirement: \n- Low latency moves (<200ms e2e)\n- Consistency > availability (pause, don't drift)\n- Scale: 500k concurrent games (~1M connection)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirement:\n- Find opponent via skill-based matchmatching\n- Play real-time game with server-validated moves\n- View global leaderboard\n\n\nNon-functional requirement: \n- Low latency moves (<200ms e2e)\n- Consistency > availability (pause, don't drift)\n- Scale: 500k concurrent games (~1M connection)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
