      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Shard pool across redis\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Shard pool across redis\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "WN-r9RIAU58DZHXbZH3sc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1116.828125,
      "y": 1129.9609375,
      "width": 852.8795166015625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 140516662,
      "version": 88,
      "versionNonce": 962251754,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785954210832,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- probably not need, A single-threaded Redis node serves sorted-set ops in the low \nhundreds of thousands per second, so our hottest key sits under a third of one node \nwith 4-5x headroom. The pool itself is small, a few tens of thousands of entries, \ncomfortably under 100MB.\n ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- probably not need, A single-threaded Redis node serves sorted-set ops in the low \nhundreds of thousands per second, so our hottest key sits under a third of one node \nwith 4-5x headroom. The pool itself is small, a few tens of thousands of entries, \ncomfortably under 100MB.\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
